    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESCAPE FROM BOYKISSER </strong>is a psychological horror game that immerses the player in the sterile rooms of<strong> BACKROOMS.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Setting:</strong> Immerse yourself in an atmosphere where time seems to stand still, and people lose themselves both in space and within their own minds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Formidable Opponent:</strong> On your journey, you will encounter the mysterious inhabitant of these places, known as <strong>BOYKISSER</strong>. He already senses your presence and roams his lair in search of prey. Will you be able to avoid his gaze?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grim Journey: </strong>As you wander and gather pieces of the puzzle, you will learn all the secrets of this strange place and may even come closer to solving them.</p></li></ul>",
